# GW4 (notes/claude/wu/gw4.md): Updategeschiedenis and Geavanceerde opties, the design's §3.6 tables; advAutoOpenDays is §3.6's
# advAutoOpenDesc first sentence (only while on) with a zero form of GW4's own (update-notifier's 0 = at once) and the one
# form "elke dag" (§3.6's "om de 1 dag" reads as every other day; GW4 review m7).
