# R3-UI (notes/claude/round3/r3-ui.md; plan.md D-G44): the Windows 11 24H2 parts §3.6 lacked (GW4 review N8): the
# restart-notification row's description, the "Aanvullende opties" header, Updategeschiedenis' "Gerelateerde
# instellingen" with its Herstel row (the header is common.js's existing `related`), and the held Snap refreshes in
# Windows' pause wording (snaps.held, GW4 review m9).
